    },
    {
        "text": "You even defeated the reinforcements? I shouldn't have expected less from you, Talulah!",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Infected Fighter"
    },
    {
        "tag": "character",
        "name": "avg_npc_080",
        "name2": "avg_npc_078",
        "focus": 2
    },
    {
        "text": "What about all the other Infected?",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Talulah"
    },
    {
        "tag": "character",
        "name": "avg_npc_080",
        "name2": "avg_npc_078",
        "focus": 1
    },
    {
        "text": "They all made it in one piece. The backup safehouse we found really came in great use.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Infected Fighter"
    },
    {
        "tag": "character",
        "name": "avg_npc_080",
        "name2": "avg_npc_078",
        "focus": 2
    },
    {
        "text": "Have you done a headcount yet?",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Talulah"
    },
    {
        "tag": "character",
        "name": "avg_npc_080"
    },
    {
        "tag": "stopmusic",
        "fadetime": 1
    },
    {
        "text": "I did. Some of the kids were crying about how one of the older girls hasn't come back yet...",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Infected Fighter"
    },
    {
        "text": "It's sad, but this happens fairly often these days. *Sigh*.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Infected Fighter"
    },
    {
        "tag": "character",
        "name": "avg_npc_078#8"
    },
    {
        "text": "......",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Talulah"
    },
    {
        "tag": "dialog"
    },
    {
        "tag": "character"
    },
    {
        "tag": "playsound",
        "key": "$rungeneral",
        "volume": 1
    },
    {
        "tag": "delay",
        "time": 2
    },
    {
        "tag": "character",
        "name": "avg_npc_058"
    },
    {
        "text": "Talulah! We found the rest of the patrol unit. Looks like they've just been running away the whole time.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Shieldguard"
    },
    {
        "tag": "character",
        "name": "avg_npc_078#5"
    },
    {
        "text": "Which way did they go?",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Talulah"
    },
    {
        "tag": "character",
        "name": "avg_npc_058"
    },
    {
        "text": "East. Makes me wonder if they'll come across the folks we exiled.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Shieldguard"
    },
    {
        "tag": "dialog"
    },
    {
        "tag": "character"
    },
    {
        "tag": "playsound",
        "key": "$rungeneral",
        "volume": 1
    },
    {
        "tag": "delay",
        "time": 1
    },
    {
        "tag": "character",
        "name": "avg_npc_058"
    },
    {
        "text": "\u2014Talulah?!",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Shieldguard"
    },
    {
        "tag": "character",
        "name": "avg_npc_080"
    },
    {
        "text": "H-Hold on! Talulah, where are you going?",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Infected Fighter"
    },
    {
        "tag": "dialog"
    },
