    {
        "text": "Alina lies there on the ground."
    },
    {
        "text": "She grips firmly onto the empty basket in her hand. Her clothes are dyed red with her own blood."
    },
    {
        "text": "The grass and the mud around her body, once pale white, have been dyed a dark shade no less intense or florid."
    },
    {
        "text": "The snow keeps falling, relentlessly."
    },
    {
        "tag": "dialog"
    },
    {
