        "block": false
    },
    {
        "tag": "playsound",
        "key": "$d_gen_walk_n"
    },
    {
        "text": "I'm worried. Talulah, I'm so worried. If I'm not here anymore, you must have Yelena remind you... All this...",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Alina"
    },
    {
        "text": "Alina, stop! Don't go on! I don't... I don't want you gone. All of you need to be here with me. You, Yelena, Sasha, Eno... All of you...",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Talulah"
    },
    {
        "text": "I don't want to lose any of you...!",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Talulah"
    },
    {
        "text": "Talulah... but all of us...",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Alina"
    },
    {
        "text": "All of us met... so that we could part one day.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Alina"
    },
    {
        "tag": "dialog"
    },
    {
        "tag": "character"
    },
