    },
    {
        "text": "The snowstorm is growing."
    },
    {
        "tag": "dialog"
    },
    {
        "tag": "image",
        "image": "avg_8_7_1",
        "x": -20,
        "xScale": 1.1,
        "yScale": 1.1,
        "fadetime": 0
    },
    {
        "tag": "blocker",
        "a": 0,
        "fadetime": 2,
        "block": true
    },
    {
        "tag": "character"
    },
    {
        "text": "Talu...lah...?",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Alina"
    },
    {
        "text": "I'm listening, Alina. Tell me. What's the matter?",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Talulah"
    },
    {
        "text": "...Snow... is warmer... than I ever imagined.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Alina"
    },
    {
        "text": "I'm sorry... I still don't... have all the things we talked about... written down.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Alina"
    },
    {
        "text": "It's okay. It's okay, Alina. It doesn't matter.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Talulah"
    },
    {
        "text": "The children... Eno in particular... You need to...",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Alina"
    },
    {
        "text": "I'm listening! Go on, Alina... I'm listening!!",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Talulah"
    },
    {
        "text": "You need to... do more... than just talk to him...",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Alina"
    },
    {
        "text": "It's getting hot... Talulah...",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Alina"
    },
    {
        "text": "...I don't want to die... I still haven't... your sister...",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Alina"
    },
    {
        "text": "......",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Talulah"
    },
    {
        "text": "You must... live on...",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Alina"
    },
    {
        "tag": "dialog"
    },
    {
