    {
        "tag": "delay",
        "time": 2
    },
    {
        "tag": "character",
        "name": "avg_npc_037#2"
    },
    {
        "tag": "camerashake",
        "duration": 0.4,
        "xstrength": 0,
        "ystrength": 8,
        "vibrato": 30,
        "randomness": 30,
        "fadeout": true,
        "block": false
    },
    {
        "text": "Talulah! You're finally back! You didn't answer our calls, what\u2014",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Yeti Squad Member"
    },
    {
        "text": "...What... Who's that on your back...?",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Yeti Squad Member"
    },
    {
        "text": "She's not breathing! Medic! Get over here, now! Talulah, just hang on...",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Yeti Squad Member"
    },
    {
        "text": "...Talulah?",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Yeti Squad Member"
    },
    {
        "text": "(What? She's walking right by... Where is she going?!)",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Yeti Squad Member"
    },
    {
        "tag": "character",
        "name": "avg_npc_058"
    },
    {
        "text": "Talulah, you may be the leader here, but that doesn't make it any less serious to leave\u2014",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Shieldguard"
    },
    {
        "tag": "character",
        "name": "char_1505_frstar_1#10"
    },
    {
        "text": "Wait.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "FrostNova"
    },
    {
        "tag": "character",
        "name": "char_1505_frstar_1#10",
        "name2": "avg_npc_058",
        "focus": 2
    },
    {
        "text": "Yelena...?",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Shieldguard"
    },
    {
        "tag": "character",
        "name": "char_1505_frstar_1#10",
        "name2": "avg_npc_058",
        "focus": 1
    },
    {
        "text": "......",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "FrostNova"
    },
    {
        "text": "Let her go.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "FrostNova"
    },
    {
        "tag": "character",
        "name": "char_1505_frstar_1#10",
        "name2": "avg_npc_058",
        "focus": 2
    },
    {
        "text": "(Do you know the poor little girl...?)",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Shieldguard"
    },
    {
        "tag": "character",
        "name": "char_1505_frstar_1#10"
    },
    {
        "text": "(Not really. I think... she's a teacher at the settlement.)",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "FrostNova"
    },
    {
        "tag": "character",
        "name": "avg_npc_058"
    },
    {
        "text": "(Oh, she's a teacher. Poor kids. That's another person they could look up to, gone.)",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Shieldguard"
    },
    {
        "text": "(But why is Talulah...)",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Shieldguard"
    },
    {
        "tag": "character",
        "name": "char_1505_frstar_1#10"
    },
    {
        "text": "(Everyone has secrets they want to keep to themselves..)",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "FrostNova"
    },
    {
        "text": "(Whatever happened, it's hers alone to remember.)",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "FrostNova"
    },
