    {
        "text": "With the Elafia still on her back, the Draco walks past the encampment. Their contours slowly begin to blur until they both disappear into the edge of the forest."
    },
    {
        "text": "No one knows what happened after that."
    },
    {
        "text": "They could only watch as the Draco walked into the darkness of the night."
    },
